## 1. Scope

This reference covers cold shrink terminations and joints for 26/35 kV cable, the upper end of the medium voltage range. At this class the electric stress in the accessory is high enough that installation repeatability matters as much as the design itself.

## 2. Construction

- Pre-expanded elastomeric insulating body with integrated geometric stress control.
- Conductive deflector moulded into the sleeve at the screen end.
- Outdoor shed profiles sized for the site pollution level.
- Sealing system closing the sheath and terminal interfaces.

